{"lang":"en","summary":"Navigation: 行为面试MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"如何做技术选型决策？举例说明\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"行为面试\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/行为面试\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">行为面试MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"如何做技术选型决策？举例说明\" dir=\"auto\">如何做技术选型决策？举例说明</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在 Agent 项目中，你做过哪些技术选型决策？是如何做决策的？</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>一、技术选型决策框架</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">决策步骤：\n1. 明确需求约束（功能需求 + 非功能需求）\n2. 列出候选方案（至少 2-3 个）\n3. 多维度评估（性能、成本、生态、团队能力）\n4. POC 验证（关键方案做概念验证）\n5. 决策记录（为什么选 A 不选 B）\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>二、完整示例：模型选型决策</strong></p>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>需求背景</strong>：<br>\n\"我们需要为一个金融客服场景选择 LLM。要求：工具调用稳定、数据不能出境、支持私有化部署、预算有限。\"</p>\n<p><strong>候选方案</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>方案 A: Claude</th>\n<th>方案 B: GPT-4</th>\n<th>方案 C: Qwen</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>工具调用稳定性</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私有化部署</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>$$</td>\n<td>$$$</td>\n<td>$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中文能力</td>\n<td>★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★★</td>\n<td>★★★★★</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>决策过程</strong>：<br>\n\"由于金融行业数据合规要求数据不能出境，Claude 和 GPT-4 都不能满足私有化部署需求。我们选择了 Qwen-72B，原因：</p>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">支持私有化部署，数据不出域</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">中文理解能力强，适合客服场景</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">成本低，单次调用成本是 GPT-4 的 1/10</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">团队有阿里生态的技术积累\"</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>POC 验证</strong>：<br>\n\"我们在 100 条测试集上做了对比：</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">意图识别准确率：Qwen 92% vs GPT-4 94%（差距可接受）</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">工具调用成功率：Qwen 95% vs GPT-4 97%</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">响应延迟：Qwen 1.2s vs GPT-4 2.1s（本地部署更快）\"</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>三、技术选型评分卡</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">TECH_SELECTION_CRITERIA <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"performance\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.25</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 性能表现</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"cost\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.20</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>             <span class=\"token comment\"># 成本</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"ecosystem\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.15</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>        <span class=\"token comment\"># 生态成熟度</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"team_capability\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.15</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 团队能力匹配</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"security\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.15</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>         <span class=\"token comment\"># 安全性/合规</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"scalability\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token number\">0.10</span>       <span class=\"token comment\"># 可扩展性</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"如果选型后发现不理想，会怎么做？\"</strong> — 建立快速验证机制，设定回退条件，准备备选方案</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>\"如何说服团队接受你的选型？\"</strong> — 用数据说话，做 POC 对比，让团队参与决策过程</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E8%A1%8C%E4%B8%BA%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">行为面试MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}